{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13367","headline":"东峰亭各赋一物得阴崖竹 · 袁邕","name":"东峰亭各赋一物得阴崖竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终岁寒苔色，寂寥幽思深。\n朝歌犹夕岚，日永流清阴。\n龙锺负烟雪，自有凌云心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁邕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}